#sortorder:3
#showas:游牧星系
This scenario exhibits the pure wildness of a nomadic galaxy. With the exception of the homeworlds, every planet will periodically move, causing wormhole links to shift constantly. 

Your main opponent is the Vengeful AI type (difficulty 7), which reacts poorly to attacks on its infrastructure and sends exostrikes in retaliation. 

There are several minor factions to contend with as well.

The Zenith Miners will come to ravage or consume worlds if their probes aren't dealt with. These can even destroy the Dyson Sphere!

Scattered throughout the galaxy there are Risk Analyzers, which influence AIP. Capture planets with these structures and these will reduce AIP over time.

The Macrophage also have a scattered presence but their spores may be able to exploit the shifting dynamics of the galaxy map. 